@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = PASTE_YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE


### =========================================================
### FOOD SEARCH
### =========================================================


### 1. Search without filters
# Expected:
# - page defaults to 1
# - limit defaults to 20
# - returns active global foods + my custom foodsks
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 2. Search by English name
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=chicken
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 3. Search should be case-insensitive
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=CHICKEN
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 4. Search with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=chicken&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 5. Second page
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=chicken&page=2&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 6. Filter by category only
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?category=POULTRY
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 7. Search + category
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=chicken&category=POULTRY
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 8. Search another common food
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=rice
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 9. Search something that probably does not exist
# Expected:
# items: []
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=zzzzzzzzzzzz
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}



### =========================================================
### QUERY VALIDATION TESTS
### These should FAIL with your validation error response.
### =========================================================


### 10. Invalid page: cannot be 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 11. Invalid negative page
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?page=-1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 12. Invalid limit: maximum is 50
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?limit=51
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 13. Invalid limit: minimum is 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?limit=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 14. Invalid page: must be integer
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?page=1.5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 15. Invalid page: not a number
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?page=hello
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 16. Empty search
# After trim(), search becomes ""
# Your .min(1) should reject it.
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 17. Search containing only spaces
# URL encoded spaces
# trim() -> "" -> should fail
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=%20%20%20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 18. Search longer than 100 chars
# Should fail .max(100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 19. Unknown query field
# Because your Zod object is .strict(), this should fail.
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?randomThing=hello
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}



### =========================================================
### AUTH TEST
### =========================================================


### 20. Missing access token
# Should be rejected by authenticateToken before controller.
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?search=chicken